<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <article class="card" style="padding: clamp(var(--space-6), 2vw + 1rem, var(--space-8));">
      <div class="featured-eyebrow">Host &amp; venue</div>
      <h2>University of Macedonia, Thessaloniki</h2>
      <p>
        Each year, the EISS conference is organised on a rotational basis in a different European
        country. The 2025 conference was held at the University of Macedonia.
      </p>
      {# Travel directions as text. They were a screenshot of a text panel,
         which no screen reader, zoom or translation tool can read (RGAA 1.8). #}
      <p><strong>University of Macedonia</strong>, Egnatia 156, Thessaloniki 546 36, Greece.</p>
      <h3>Getting around</h3>
      <p>The venue is close to the city centre, about a 10-minute walk from Thessaloniki's main shopping area and university quarter. The closest bus stops are Panepistimio Makedonias and Agia Fotini, served by local lines 2K, 14, 27 and 31.</p>
      <p>Bus tickets are sold at kiosks or in the OASTH app. A standard ticket costs 0.90 EUR and is valid for 70 minutes. More information at <a href="https://oasth.gr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">oasth.gr</a>.</p>
      <h3>From the main train station</h3>
      <p>It is a 25-minute walk. Alternatively, take bus 8 or 31 from the station to the Panepistimio Makedonias stop. The venue is right across the street.</p>
      <h3>From the airport</h3>
      <p>Thessaloniki Airport "Makedonia" is about 17 km away: around 30 to 40 minutes by car, or 50 to 60 minutes by public transport.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Airport bus 01X to Panepistimio or Agia Fotini. The venue is a short walk from either stop.</li>
        <li>Airport bus 01X to the city centre, then change at Plateia Aristotelous to bus 27 or 31 towards the university.</li>
        <li>By taxi, about 30 minutes and 25 to 35 EUR. Apps such as Beat or Uber Taxi also work.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm"
           href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/search?query=University+of+Macedonia,+Thessaloniki"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on OpenStreetMap</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
